step	1	-	Quick guide step 1
line	<col=000080>Ensure that you have 2 empty inventory slots.</col>
step	2	-	Quick guide step 2
line	<str>Ensure that you have 2 empty inventory slots.</str>
line	
line	<col=000080>Talk to <col=800000>Lady Servil</col> just outside of the north-east corner of the <col=800000>Tree Gnome Village</col> <col=800000>maze</col>.</col>
step	3	-	Quick guide step 3
line	<str>Ensure that you have 2 empty inventory slots.</str>
line	
line	<str>Talk to Lady Servil just outside of the north-east corner of the Tree Gnome Village maze.</str>
line	
line	<col=000080>Go to the house in the most north-eastern corner of the area and search the chest for <col=800000>Khazard armour</col>.</col>
step	4	-	Quick guide step 4
line	<str>Ensure that you have 2 empty inventory slots.</str>
line	
line	<str>Talk to Lady Servil just outside of the north-east corner of the Tree Gnome Village maze.</str>
line	
line	<str>Go to the house in the most north-eastern corner of the area and search the chest for Khazard armour.</str>
line	
line	<col=000080>Equip the armour and head south into the prison (do not unequip the armour inside!).</col>
step	5	-	Quick guide step 5
line	<str>Ensure that you have 2 empty inventory slots.</str>
line	
line	<str>Talk to Lady Servil just outside of the north-east corner of the Tree Gnome Village maze.</str>
line	
line	<str>Go to the house in the most north-eastern corner of the area and search the chest for Khazard armour.</str>
line	
line	<str>Equip the armour and head south into the prison (do not unequip the armour inside!).</str>
line	
line	<col=000080>Head inside the south-east room where the jails are located.</col>
step	6	-	Quick guide step 6
line	<str>Ensure that you have 2 empty inventory slots.</str>
line	
line	<str>Talk to Lady Servil just outside of the north-east corner of the Tree Gnome Village maze.</str>
line	
line	<str>Go to the house in the most north-eastern corner of the area and search the chest for Khazard armour.</str>
line	
line	<str>Equip the armour and head south into the prison (do not unequip the armour inside!).</str>
line	
line	<str>Head inside the south-east room where the jails are located.</str>
line	
line	<col=000080>Talk to the <col=800000>Head Guard</col> in the south most room of the jail near the staircase. The right guard will mention that he wants a "decent drink," saying he will fall asleep with too much Khali brew.</col>
step	7	-	Quick guide step 7
line	<str>Ensure that you have 2 empty inventory slots.</str>
line	
line	<str>Talk to Lady Servil just outside of the north-east corner of the Tree Gnome Village maze.</str>
line	
line	<str>Go to the house in the most north-eastern corner of the area and search the chest for Khazard armour.</str>
line	
line	<str>Equip the armour and head south into the prison (do not unequip the armour inside!).</str>
line	
line	<str>Head inside the south-east room where the jails are located.</str>
line	
line	<str>Talk to the Head Guard in the south most room of the jail near the staircase. The right guard will mention that he wants a "decent drink," saying he will fall asleep with too much Khali brew.</str>
line	
line	<col=000080>Go to outside, and head to the bar, located in the west and buy a <col=800000>Khali brew</col> for five coins from Khazard barman (if you didn't talk to the right guard, the option is not there).</col>
step	8	-	Quick guide step 8
line	<str>Ensure that you have 2 empty inventory slots.</str>
line	
line	<str>Talk to Lady Servil just outside of the north-east corner of the Tree Gnome Village maze.</str>
line	
line	<str>Go to the house in the most north-eastern corner of the area and search the chest for Khazard armour.</str>
